{
  "_doc": "Curated storytelling SFX bank. `./sv sfx build` fetches every entry (CC0, via Openverse → Freesound previews; or the Freesound API when FREESOUND_API_KEY is set), trims, normalises and indexes it into banks/sfx/<category>/. dur = acceptable source length in seconds. n = variants to keep (variants avoid the 'same whoosh every cut' tell). Add entries freely; ids must be unique.",
  "categories": {
    "transitions": "whooshes, swishes, whips, risers — placed automatically on scene cuts",
    "impacts": "booms, hits, thuds, sub drops — for reveals and hard cuts",
    "text-ui": "typing, clicks, pops, shutters, notifications, glitches",
    "paper": "page turns, rustles, crumples, pen on paper",
    "body": "heartbeats, breathing, footsteps, gasps, knocks",
    "horror": "creaks, drones, stingers, whispers, bells, animals of the night",
    "ambience": "long loopable beds: rain, wind, fire, night, city, rooms",
    "objects": "clocks, glass, keys, matches, locks, doors, water, coins",
    "tension": "drones, pulses, rising tension, heartbeat-like rhythm beds",
    "cinematic": "stingers, shimmers, reveals, braams",
    "nature": "thunder, birds, waves, storms",
    "crowd": "murmur, gasps, applause, laughter, children"
  },
